 "text": "Menominee County | Departments » Courts\nGovernment\nAgendas & Minutes\nBoards & Committees\nEmployment\nForms & Documents\nMunicipalities\nServices\nDepartments\n9-1-1 (Central Dispatch)\nAdministration\nBuilding Codes\nClerk\nCounty Board of Commissioners\nCounty Fair\nCourts\nEmergency Management\nEqualization\nFriend of the Court\nLand Information Services (GIS)\nMenominee County Library\nMenominee Regional Airport\nParks & Recreation\nProsecuting Attorney\nRegister of Deeds\nRoad Commission\nSheriff\nTreasurer\nVeteran Services\nCommunity\nArea Information\nCUPPAD\nM & M Regional Guide\nMenominee Conservation District\nMenominee County 4-H\nMichigan Department of Health & Human Services\nMichigan State University - Extension\nNorthpointe Behavioral Health\nPublic Health - Delta & Menominee Counties\nUPCAP - Upper Peninsula Commission for Area Progress\nMore\nCalendar\nContact Us\nEmail Alerts\nFAQ\nLinks\nNews\nStaff Directory\n-->\nCOURTS |\n|\n• General Information |\n|\n• 95A District Court |\n|\n• 41st Circuit Court |\n|\n• Probate Court |\n|\n• Family Court |\n|\n-->\n- Select Section --> COURTS General Information 95A District Court 41st Circuit Court Probate Court Family Court DEPARTMENTS HOME\nCourts\nWELCOME TO THE MENOMINEE COUNTY MICHIGAN COURT SYSTEM\nCourts play a crucial role in the legal system by resolving disputes, interpreting laws, protecting rights, enforcing laws, and maintaining social order. They operate within a structured framework that ensures justice is accessible and fair for all citizens. Courts are essential to upholding the rule of law and ensuring that individual rights are respected in society.\nCopyright © 2026 Menominee County\nGovernment - Menominee Michigan\nMenominee County Courthouse\n839 10th Avenue\nMenominee, MI 49858\n(906) 863-7779\nLegal Notice\nPrivacy Notice\nAcceptable Use Policy\nLinking Policy\nDesigned & Powered By:",
